WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:05.840
In the African wilderness, a wild beast desecrates
your loved ones’ graves, and spawns disease

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.240
and blight with just a glance in your direction.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:14.350
Able to wander essentially undetected among
people during the day, at night it transforms

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:19.350
into a terrifying creature—the werehyena.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:23.650
Associated with death, gluttony, and greed,
this monster joins the ranks of werewolves,

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.640
selkies, and other shapeshifting monsters.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.860
Werecreatures—humans or animals that can
shapeshift from one form into another—are

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:36.350
common across the globe, taking different
forms based on the real predators in the local

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:37.440
area.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:42.059
Most familiar to a western audience is the
werewolf, but given that there are four different

00:00:42.059 --> 00:00:46.780
species of hyena in Africa, it’s not so
surprising that the version of the monster

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:51.269
we find in that continent looks more like
this than this.

00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:58.389
There’s way more to these monsters than
in the Buffy episode.

00:00:58.389 --> 00:01:01.469
So let’s look at the werehyena of African
folklore.

00:01:01.469 --> 00:01:05.870
And how the Beta Israel religious group became
commonly accused of taking the guise of this

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.780
monster.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:11.610
[Monstrum intro.]

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:18.850
A werehyena is most commonly believed to be
a hyena masquerading by day as a human, as

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:24.480
opposed to the more western figure of a werewolf,
which is a human who turns into a wolf, usually

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.610
at night.

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:31.530
A werehyena’s human skin is the false one,
and while a werehyena in human form may be

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:36.980
noticed by an unusually hairy body or nasally
voice, more often than not they can walk among

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.060
humans unnoticed.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:43.550
In the wild plains of Africa, hyenas stand
out as repugnant animals.

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:49.480
Though often thought of merely as opportunistic
scavengers, in reality their cunning tactics,

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:55.090
knife-like teeth, and surprising swiftness
make these animals formidable foes.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:59.820
Hyenas are often considered the outsiders
of the animal world characterized as unnatural

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:05.480
and disgusting since they consume rotten flesh,
and associated with greed since they steal

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.070
the kills of other animals.

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:11.959
While they won’t turn their nose down at
rotting flesh, hyenas are intelligent hunters

00:02:11.959 --> 00:02:15.349
capable of taking down wildebeest and antelope.

00:02:15.349 --> 00:02:20.959
Add in a human skinsuit so it can wander among
us by day and you have yourself one terrifying

00:02:20.959 --> 00:02:21.959
monster.

00:02:21.959 --> 00:02:27.420
In Sudan, Tanzania, Ethiopia, and some parts
of Morocco and Eritrea werehyena

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:32.299
are associated with groups of outsiders who
are accused of possessing magical abilities

00:02:32.299 --> 00:02:35.790
and the powerful stare of an evil eye.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:39.989
Called, Buda or bouda, a derogatory
title, Buda are thought to control animal

00:02:39.989 --> 00:02:45.320
spirits intentionally or unintentionally,
cause illness, poison people’s food and

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.829
-- shapeshift into a hyena.

00:02:47.829 --> 00:02:53.499
Buda and werehyenas are most often associated
with artisan trades like metal working, weaving,

00:02:53.499 --> 00:02:58.909
and pottery and their evil powers are said
to be passed on from generation to generation,

00:02:58.909 --> 00:03:01.129
much like skills of a trade.

00:03:01.129 --> 00:03:04.610
Almost all Buda are described as “landless
people.”

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:08.849
And the people most commonly associated with
landlessness and of being smiths and potters

00:03:08.849 --> 00:03:12.480
in eastern Africa are the Ethiopian Jews.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:17.010
Self -identifying as the Beta Israel, this
group is a religious and professional minority

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:22.040
in the largely Christian country of Ethiopia
that coalesced into a more unified group by

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.560
the 15th century.

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:27.889
Origins of the group’s faith are hotly debated
in scholarship, but what is generally agreed

00:03:27.889 --> 00:03:33.360
upon is that the group started in one of the
so called “heretic” communities in Ethiopia.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:37.150
People outside of the group called the Beta
Israel “Ayhud” or “Falasha,” which

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:41.840
at their base meaning, refers to Jews and
the Jewish community but are also synonymous

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:44.739
with “exiles” and those who practiced
“magic.”

00:03:44.739 --> 00:03:47.950
Both terms are considered derogatory.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:51.999
The derogatory name Falasha as a designator
for the Beta Israel first became a widespread

00:03:51.999 --> 00:03:54.059
term in the 16th century onward.

00:03:54.059 --> 00:04:00.170
By then, the definition of a Falasi is a landless
person, a wanderer, an exile.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:05.260
So how and why did the Beta Israel become
associated with werehyenas?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:10.749
In the late 15th and early 16th century, the
masonry and carpentry skills of the Beta Israel

00:04:10.749 --> 00:04:12.430
were highly valued.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:17.010
Their contributions to infrastructure and
architecture led to a rise in their economic

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.120
and social mobility.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:21.690
They were also noted soldiers in the imperial
army.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:25.500
Their rewards for their skills on and off
the battlefield even led to the gifting of

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:29.970
titles and land to the Beta Israel, which
if you remember, directly contradicts the

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:31.360
definition of Buda.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:37.400
Then in 1769 Ethiopia, Emperor Iyo’as was
assassinated, causing political and social

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:42.440
upheaval, and pushing marginalized peoples,
including the Beta Israel, into other trades

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.260
like pottery and smithing.

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:47.540
It also placed their religious practices under
attack.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:52.880
These new craft professions of the Beta Israel—smithery
for the men, and pottery for the women—had

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.320
one big thing in common.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.450
Fire.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:05:01.130
Across history fire is associated with magic,
because what’s more magical than using fire

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:07.540
to transform a seemingly useless material—like
iron or clay—into a knife or a bowl?

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.590
Christians believed Beta Israel's superior
skills were supernatural.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:16.170
It is an almost universal theme in African
cultures that metalworkers, like the Buda,

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.880
are associated with malevolent spellcraft.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:23.500
Such artisans are often “landless” moving
from place to place as necessary for their

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:27.470
profession, leasing farming land as tenants
from Christian landholders.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:32.150
Their more nomadic lifestyle alienated them
from permanent residents, and cast suspicion

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:34.070
upon their motives.

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:39.440
And people began to wonder, could these individuals
practicing crafts with such transformative

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:43.390
powers be able to transform their bodies as
well?

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:47.400
Christians of the day chose a dramatic way
to “other” the community and claimed all

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:50.950
the Ethiopian Jews were Buda—designating
them dangerous.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:57.090
In fact, many Christians actually believed
the Beta Israel assumed human disguises during

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:01.310
the day, and returned to their natural hyena
form during the night.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:05.970
Very different from other types of werecreatures
in global lore, most famously the werewolf,

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:12.290
instead of a human turning into an animal,
these werehyenas were animals that shapeshifted

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:15.620
into humans.

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:20.690
Another bit of anti-Semetic lore further stigmatized
Beta Israel blacksmiths, claiming they descended

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:25.130
from the Jewish smith who crafted the nails
used to crucify Jesus.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:29.470
This accusation further classified the Beta
Israel as Buda.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:34.180
Some people even began referring to them as
the “Hyena People” an association that

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:37.920
equated them with an animal largely seen as
disgusting.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:42.920
These continuing prejudices saw blood libel
accusations, the allegations of the ritual

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:48.200
murder of Christians and the Beta Israel were
charged with turning into hyenas and draining

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:53.020
the blood of their victims by vampiric means,
or by afflicting them with an illness that

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:55.020
required medical blood letting.

00:06:55.020 --> 00:07:00.880
Buda werehyena lore asserts that this blood
was used for rituals, medicine, and nutrition.

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:05.810
In modern Ethiopia, buda is still a derogatory,
alienating insult.

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:10.200
And nowadays it's illegal to accuse someone
of being a werehyena.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:16.270
Werecreature folklore exists across the globe,
and in my observation, the werehyena is unique

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:20.050
in its direct connection to a specific religious
group.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:25.760
The relationship between werehyenas, Buda,
and the Beta Israel gives us yet another example

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:30.950
of how outsider groups are demonized by people
in positions of power, and who perpetuate

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:39.697
myths like this one as a means of social control
to keep those deemed as “monstrous” oppressed.

